Description: Halberd BAS - Open-source Breach and Attack Simulation
 Lightweight breach and attack simulation platform for small teams.
 Includes MITRE ATT&CK-mapped atomic techniques and multi-step attack
 chains with a web dashboard for coverage visualization and reporting.
